# Agent / tool local artifacts — never commit. (A `git add -A` once swept these
# into a commit; staging explicit paths + ignoring here prevents recurrence.)
.playwright-mcp/
# spec-kit / gitnexus / serena / superpowers: local-only dev tooling and one-off
# agent output, not managed in GitHub (per owner). Serena memories and superpowers
# audit dumps regenerate per machine and went stale faster than they were read.
.specify/
.agents/
.gitnexus/
.serena/
admin-app/.serena/
.superpowers/
# Ad-hoc screenshots dumped at the repo root by browser/agent runs (no root *.png
# is tracked). Use `git add -f` if a root-level PNG ever needs committing.
/*.png
